{"title":"What should I ask Andrew Graham-Dixon?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/951971879/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Andrew-GrahamDixon.html","date":1774626271000,"content":"<p>He is one of the world’s leading art critics, all of his books are excellent, and he has a new and very good work coming out titled <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Vermeer-Life-Found-Andrew-Graham-Dixon/dp/1324124113/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1Q3O2RXRTS8FI&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.2JkmKH8wg5bGlBetwTj8R8ozuRiXbPdIYwEAFM5qsKwlsNQvKx7tHNvKMe_LgFh-fbcV-bjR56_043c1TzZnkumRq_ZyQXEbidq6eApTqZ-rULNWIgGcatiVaBDGxwaZj2ItDvSnKtJR-G3Zce233g.ppLM-Hn3D7JG2HcaR_1DHkOjfr_bwGuFUREdYPOOAws&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=andrew+graham+dixon+vermeer&amp;qid=1774564703&amp;sprefix=andrew+grah%2Caps%2C223&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Vermeer: A Life Lost and Found</a>.  He also has a well-known book on Caravaggio, on Michelangelo, and I am especially fond of his book on British art.</p>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrew_Graham-Dixon\" target=\"_blank\">his Wikipedia page</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.andrewgrahamdixon.com/index.html\" target=\"_blank\">his home page</a>.  So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/what-should-i-ask-andrew-graham-dixon.html\">What should I ask Andrew Graham-Dixon?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/951971879/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/951971879/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fbl